    <!-- lameta-source {"folderType":"session","folderId":"INT_2022_0787","fieldKey":"description"} -->
    <Description>Greta Yılmaz talks about drawing with a ladder. The artist answered every question with a question, and then with a long pause, which the transcript renders as "…".</Description>
